  "description": "Dropbox-style file sync for Shiny.Net.HttpServer. Files are split into content-defined chunks and stored once by hash, so editing a large file moves only the chunks that changed, and a copy or an older version costs nothing to re-upload. Includes a change feed with long-poll, optimistic revisions for conflict detection, and resumable pack uploads over tus. Pair it with Shiny.Net.HttpServer.FileSync.Client. Trim- and AOT-clean.",
